    [BugFix][KV Pool][v0.30.0] Skip SSD offload registration for scheduler-only Mooncake clients (#18262)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Port the fix and regression coverage from #18238 to releases/v0.30.0.
    The original fix was introduced in #11854 for releases/v0.23.0.
    
    Scheduler-only Mooncake clients use contribute_memory=False but still
    pass SSD offload settings to store.setup(), registering extra
    SSD-enabled clients and inflating the active client count and reported
    SSD usage. Strip these arguments for scheduler-only clients while
    preserving worker SSD offload, per-rank directories, and tenant
    settings.
    
    The regression test covers shared transfer engine, fabric memory, and
    independent transfer engine initialization, including zero scheduler
    memory allocation and no SSD directory creation.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
